CT3['E01.05.04']=(None,'Durable, controlled references support access to large externally managed media outside ordinary Information Unit persistence, preserving integrity, identity and access context without Harmonia assuming custody of the original media objects.')
CT3['E05.01.02']=(None,'Internal Harmonia systems, components and automated principals can authenticate to the services they are authorised to use, establishing valid identity and trust and rejecting expired or revoked trust.')
CT3['E05.01.04']=(None,'Services and workloads authenticate across the boundary between Harmonia and external systems, maintaining valid machine-to-machine trust and rejecting expired or revoked trust without conflating workload identity with human business authority.')
